================================================================================
WHAT THE LICENCE ABOVE COVERS
================================================================================

The MIT terms above apply to the original work created for this project:

    server/            the replacement backend
    release/           the launcher, its build script and tests
    client/dev_tools/  the analysis, memory-reading and turn-driving tools
    docs/              the reverse-engineering reports and documentation
    setup.ps1, run_server.ps1

================================================================================
WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER
================================================================================

    client/CosmicSupremacy.exe
    client/CosmicSupremacy_Resurgence.exe
    client/CosmicSupremacy_TestBed.exe
    client/*.csgalaxy
    every game asset contained inside those binaries

Cosmic Supremacy was created by Erwin and released around 2006. Those files are
the author's work, not ours, and no licence is claimed or granted over them.
They are included here, in modified form, for one reason: the servers went dark
years ago and without them the game cannot be played at all.

This is an unofficial preservation project. It is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the original author. It is free and always will be — never sold,
never carrying advertising, and never accepting payment for access.

If you are the copyright holder and want these files removed, or would like the
work handed over so you can restore the game yourself, open an issue on the
repository and it will be done.
